d": "134778495298719", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982471_134778498632052_411711373724603695_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pZ1EpzHioKkQ7kNvwG6KXKR&_nc_oc=Ado5d30RC66d9eHTNTr1RE8IuA4Szz9UkWAOyny-IVVMAeG58hacDEU_-PBBW-hEVr8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKssua4yQmhPFH1k0Iz-Eh9-K-ZKXdhnRoTKq9sYZ87QA&oe=6A9C0DA4"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "798605747754490", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982483_798605754421156_1986649763789961237_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K2ycxpj382cQ7kNvwGMADxq&_nc_oc=AdpS1Rgxlqx2_VLDkrZsntVE13RncGzM14Pqud3OSNRdPegu7Rnr4PGprzeyOjJI6BY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJP1ZkwCshEadIVwmg3Kv8zpM5ubtQ3yaDXY9S2RV9gJg&oe=6A9C2765"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "263294812157372", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035358_263294815490705_4150129998500296228_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NS69UYiBKZQQ7kNvwGAB6Oz&_nc_oc=Adrwm0Vo6vRHtQmFmCVAqdJT9JEsp4zdXfZoIvwYBFFzeG5i01ZWa-iVWG5iAz7IzrQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIPDYDtmgRMR5eoaEumAQkRexOkSK_3mmzIllQHytdXQQ&oe=6A9C3A27"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Modulia Quest - screenshot.png", "id": "522084335580003", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982449_522084338913336_7694930828877611739_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p_CJCoy5QC0Q7kNvwHr_T4l&_nc_oc=AdofRnex53GkpDU9ouT06YI9KYrgGzM4Ftf_RvNn5smyfPguG0Y4oCv-xm9ADsl0vdI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKQW-hNrABK6-CtdwX-G8jcomuS85hDg2HT2Tb0nY4ltw&oe=6A9C2B11"}, "display_name": "Modulia Studio", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Modulia Studio is a VR MIDI controller. \n\nIt allows you to wirelessly control any MIDI-compatible software and has an especially deep integration with Ableton Live\u2122 10 & 11. It also features a standalone mode with embedded sounds.\n\nBuild your custom studio using the 11 different modules:\n\n- Session (controls the session view of Live\u2122)\n- Circular Keyboard (a beautiful 360\u00b0 keyboard)\n- Scale Keyboard (a versatile scaled keyboard)\n- Expressive Keyboard (a MIDI-MPE keyboard for expressive performances)\n- Remote (remotely triggers multiple notes and visual effects at once)\n- Pads (a 4x4 pads grid)\n- Cube Mixer (a 3D mixing space)\n- Cylinder Mixer (a cylindrical 3D mixing space)\n- Knobs (4 configurable knobs)\n- Sliders (4 configurable sliders)\n- FX (visual effects)\n\nDownload Modulia Desktop for MacOS and Windows to connect Modulia Studio to your MIDI software: www.modulia-studio.com/get-modulia-studio/#desktop \n\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nAbleton\u00ae and Live\u2122 are trademarks of Ableton AG.", "short_description": "Modulia Studio is a VR MIDI controller. \n\nIt lets you wirelessly control any MIDI-compatible software and has a deep integration with Ableton Live\u2122 10 & 11. It also features a standalone mode with embedded sounds.\n\nBuild your studio using the 11 different modules:\n\n- Session\n- Circular Keyboard\n- Scale Keyboard\n- Expressive Keyboard\n- Remote\n- Pads\n- Cube Mixer\n- Cylinder Mixer\n- Knobs\n- Sliders\n- FX\n\nGet Modulia Desktop to connect Modulia Studio to your MIDI software at www.modulia-studio.com "}]}, "developer_name": "Th\u00e9r\u00e9mix Tech", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.modulia-studio.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Th\u00e9r\u00e9mix Tech", "support_website_url": "https://www.modulia-studio.com/documentation/", "website_url": "https://www.modulia-studio.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", 